Subject: [PATCH] configs: retain the resolved UN1CA One UI 9 build choices

Start from the original 14-line unica.config input, not the cached full
.config. Select the always-permissive choice actually used by the retained
cohort, then the companion 5.15.206 uname choice. The upstream builder adds
ksu.config and droidspaces.config and sets LOCALVERSION as before.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/unica.config b/arch/arm64/configs/unica.config
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/unica.config
@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+CONFIG_SECURITY_SELINUX=y
+CONFIG_SECURITY_SELINUX_DEVELOP=y
+# CONFIG_SECURITY_SELINUX_MODE_DEFAULT is not set
+# CONFIG_SECURITY_SELINUX_ALWAYS_ENFORCE is not set
+CONFIG_SECURITY_SELINUX_ALWAYS_PERMISSIVE=y
+CONFIG_MALI_MIDGARD_R54P3=m
+CONFIG_MALI_VERSION_SELECTOR=y
+CONFIG_DMABUF_HEAPS_ION_COMPAT=y
+CONFIG_ZSMALLOC_STAT=y
+CONFIG_TCP_CONG_WESTWOOD=y
+CONFIG_NET_SCH_FQ=y
+CONFIG_NET_SCH_FQ_CODEL=y
+CONFIG_BLK_DEV_THROTTLING=y
+CONFIG_SEC_DEBUG_WQ_LOCKUP_INFO=m
+# CONFIG_FAKE_UNAME_5_10 is not set
+CONFIG_FAKE_UNAME_5_15=y
